sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SM as Site Safety Manager
    participant D as Dashboard
    participant MH as MonitoringHandler
    participant AC as AccessControl
    participant WRS as WeeklyReportService
    participant EH as EventHistoryStore
    participant RA as ReportAggregator

    SM->>D: Request report for project and last 7 days
    D->>MH: GET /api/reports with project and date range
    MH->>AC: Check report-view permission
    alt Authorized
        MH->>WRS: Generate project report
        WRS->>EH: Load recorded events for date range
        EH-->>WRS: Matching event records
        alt Events exist
            WRS->>RA: Build incident list and daily histogram
            RA-->>WRS: Report data
            WRS-->>MH: Incident rows and histogram buckets
        else No events
            WRS-->>MH: Empty incident list and zero-count buckets
        end
        MH-->>D: Return report data
        D-->>SM: Display interactive list and histogram
    else Not authorized
        MH-->>D: 403 Forbidden
        D-->>SM: Show access-denied message
    end